        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Brittany Stewart currently resides in Virginia.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Stewart could travel back to Alabama to undergo embryo transfer into her uterus.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A successful embryo transfer might result in pregnancy.",
        "confidence": 0.9
