    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82221.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 14,
    "turn_text": "Republican state Senator Tim Nelson has a bill that he says would protect IVF treatment by making clear that embryos are not children unless they are implanted in a uterus. This is all just another hurdle for people like Brittany Stewart who are still trying to expand their families.",
