        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Embryo implantation is a key threshold for personhood in public policy debates.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker supports expanding access to IVF for intended parents.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Public figures like Senator Nelson play a significant role in shaping reproductive law.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Brittany Stewart represents a broader group of individuals affected by restrictive reproductive policies.",
